/target
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# Content-addressed blob storage (see src/blob_store.rs). Real filesystem
# writes, not something `:memory:` covers for the DB side — both `cargo
# run` and `cargo test` write real files here (relative to CWD, same basis
# as `lorehub.db`), so this must stay untracked the same way `*.db` is.
/blobs

# env files (real secrets) — .env.example stays tracked as the template
.env
!.env.example
